-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Yomitan
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The deinflection rule set vendored at src/common/resources/japanese-transforms.json
and the transformer in src/common/deinflect.ts are ported from Yomitan's Japanese
language transforms (ext/js/language/ja/japanese-transforms.js) and its
LanguageTransformer, by way of daidai's Ruby port.

    Yomitan — https://github.com/yomidevs/yomitan
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
daidai
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The vendored rule set and the inflection labels in src/common/deinflect.ts are
taken from daidai, which is the same gem the Shirabe website uses to name
inflections — so a chain reads identically in the extension and on the page.

    daidai — https://github.com/davafons/daidai
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.

